# D-Card API — admin: event types (EVT-5)
# Needs user_account.is_admin = true (see http/README.md › Authentication). Everyone else gets 403.


### Setup: provision the admin (then set is_admin in the database)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### All event types, including inactive
# 200 → { "eventTypes": [{ id, key, nameSw, nameEn, active }] } · 403 non-admin.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/event-types
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Non-admin → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/event-types
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}

### Create an event type
# key: 2–40 lowercase letters/digits/_ starting with a letter (normalised to lowercase; never changes).
# 201 → AdminEventType · 409 duplicate key · 422 validation. Appears in GET /api/v1/event-types while active.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/event-types
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "key": "silver_jubilee", "nameSw": "Jubilei ya fedha", "nameEn": "Silver jubilee" }

### Rename (audited)
# Any of nameSw, nameEn, active. 200 → AdminEventType · 404 unknown key.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/event-types/silver_jubilee
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nameEn": "Silver wedding jubilee" }

### Deactivate: hidden from new events; existing events keep it
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/event-types/silver_jubilee
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "active": false }

### Reactivate
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/event-types/silver_jubilee
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "active": true }
